"Direct FTLの区画境界からの暫定研究推計。topologyのkeyの対応表は確認済みですが、物理NAND配分は未検証です。中央予測は保持補正なし。研究値ではTLCのみ保持補正し、pSLCの保持係数は1.0です。" = "Provisional research estimate from Direct FTL partition boundaries. The topology key key map is reviewed; physical NAND allocation is not. Main forecasts use no retention correction. Research correction applies only to TLC, with pSLC factor 1.0.";
"同一topologyの累積anchor区間を使用し、各区間の始点容量を固定。P/E量子化を跨いで集約しています。分担率は自動正規化せず、domain主値を自動切替しない比較値です。" = "Uses cumulative anchor intervals with matching topology and fixed starting capacities, aggregating across P/E quantization. Shares are not automatically normalized, and this comparison does not switch the main domain forecast.";
