"geometryの不整合は寿命倍率へ変換していません。" = "Geometry inconsistency is not converted into an endurance multiplier.";
"642 TLC bands / 80 pSLC bandsのような整数band解を、現在のNAND counterへの当てはめから得た研究proxyです。" = "Integer band solutions, such as 642 TLC / 80 pSLC bands, are research proxies fitted to the current NAND counter.";
"NAND counterを入力に使うため、独立検証ではありません。capacityAllocationVerified=falseを維持します。" = "Uses the NAND counter as input, so this is not independent validation. capacityAllocationVerified remains false.";
"逆算band proxyはAdvancedの整合比較のみに使います。主NAND予算・残Host・到達日はDirect topology、欠測時は累積損耗N/u概算です。" = "Inferred band proxies are Advanced comparisons only. Main budgets, remaining Host writes and dates use Direct topology, falling back to cumulative-wear N/u when missing.";
