"TLC／pSLCの正規化損耗率は従来N/u比較と損耗診断に使用し、domain主予算では各容量と平均P/Eを個別に計算します。" = "Normalized TLC/pSLC wear is used for the earlier N/u comparison and wear diagnostics. The main domain budget calculates each capacity and average P/E separately.";
"Controller EOLを30°C・365日の基準点と置く研究仮定です。保持保証・JEDEC認証値ではありません。" = "A research assumption that places Controller EOL at a 30°C, 365-day reference point. It is not a retention guarantee or a JEDEC-certified value.";
"クライアント負荷のWAF 3〜4は研究用の比較範囲です。Apple個体の測定値やJEDECの規定値ではありません。" = "A WAF of 3–4 for client workloads is a research comparison range. It is not a measurement of an Apple drive or a JEDEC-specified value.";
"Vendor WriteAmp、試験WAF、cross-temperatureは診断用。主計算へ追加乗算しません。" = "Vendor WriteAmp, test WAF and cross-temperature are diagnostic. They are not multiplied into the main calculation.";
"Forecast WAFはdomain残量のHost換算のみに適用し、過去Host Writesを再評価しません。" = "Forecast WAF applies only to converting remaining domain capacity to Host. Past Host Writes are not re-evaluated.";
"Direct topologyまたはTLC／pSLCの平均P/E・EOLから有限なdomain予算を構成できません。" = "A finite domain budget can't be built from Direct topology or TLC/pSLC average P/E and EOL.";
"geometry容量は整合したIORegistry値からの研究proxyで、Appleの実効NAND容量の確認済み値ではありません。" = "Geometry capacity is a research proxy from consistent IORegistry values, not a confirmed Apple effective NAND capacity.";
"geometryが未確認または論理容量未満のため、SMART／profile論理容量を研究proxyとして使用します。" = "Geometry is unconfirmed or below logical capacity, so the S.M.A.R.T./profile logical capacity is used as a research proxy.";
"全体WAFまたはerase/geometry再構成成分が不足しているため、残差は未算出です。" = "The residual is not calculated because total WAF or the erase/geometry reconstruction components are missing.";
"全体WAF − Native成分 − Intermediate成分の負残差は0.5%以内の丸め／取得時差として0へ表示。成分は未校正で、Forecast WAFへ代入しません。" = "A negative residual of total WAF − Native − Intermediate within 0.5% is shown as 0, as rounding or read-time difference. The components are uncalibrated and are not used as Forecast WAF.";
"全体WAF − Native成分 − Intermediate成分。成分の定義・取得時刻差は未校正で、Forecast WAFへ代入しません。" = "Total WAF − Native − Intermediate. Component definitions and read-time differences are uncalibrated, and the result is not used as Forecast WAF.";
